
START PROGRAM

	Load scenario file
	Check that scenario file is valid

	Initialize simulated hardware
		Configure 4 switches
		Configure 4 LEDs
		Turn display output off

	Set previous switches to 0

	FOR every tick from 0 through the last tick

		Find the scenario values active at this tick

		Update simulated temperature and humidity
		Update simulated switches

		Calculate current timestamp = start + tick

		Read temperature register
		Read humidity register
		Convert raw values to real units

		Read current switch states

		Determine which switches were just pressed

		FOR each of the 4 switches
			IF switch was just pressed
				Toggle its corresponding LED
			END IF
		END FOR

		Read current LED states
		Print timestamp, sensors, switches,
			pressed switches, and LEDs

		Save current switches as previous switches

	END FOR

END PROGRAM
